.projectinfo

Project Name:
SkyMine

Short Description:
Browser-based 3D mining experience inspired by Minecraft visuals. Players spawn in a floating lobby/void environment with clouds, can freely fly, and mine blocks to earn points. User identity is based on auto-generated Solana wallets.

Core Concept:
- Player signs up → Solana wallet is generated
- Wallet = user identity
- Player spawns in a sky/void lobby
- Player can fly freely (no walking / gravity focus)
- Blocks spawn in front of the player
- Player mines blocks using a pickaxe
- Each block type gives points
- Simple loop: mine → score → repeat

Platform:
- Web (desktop first)
- Runs fully in browser

Tech Stack:
- Three.js (core 3D rendering)
- JavaScript / TypeScript
- WebGL
- Solana Web3.js (wallet generation)
- Optional backend (API) for:
  - Score persistence
  - Leaderboards
  - Wallet-based session tracking

User Signup & Identity:
- On first visit / signup:
  - A new Solana wallet (keypair) is generated client-side
  - Public key = user ID
- User is shown:
  - Private key / seed phrase
  - Clear instruction to save it securely
- No email, no password
- Relogin = importing private key / seed phrase
- If private key is lost:
  - Account is unrecoverable (by design)

Wallet Rules:
- Wallet is generated locally in browser
- Private key is never stored on server
- Server only stores:
  - Public key
  - Associated scores / stats
- Wallet can later be used for:
  - On-chain rewards
  - Token distribution
  - NFT / cosmetic ownership

Visual Style:
- Minecraft-inspired blocky aesthetic
- Default Minecraft-style skins
- Simple voxel blocks (cube-based)
- Floating environment with:
  - Skybox
  - Clouds
  - Void below
- Minimal UI (score, wallet address shortened)

Player Controls:
- First-person or over-the-shoulder camera
- Free flight movement:
  - WASD / mouse
  - No stamina
  - No fall damage
- Mouse click to mine block
- Visual hit / break feedback

Block Types:
- Stone
- Iron
- Grass
- Diamond

Block Mechanics:
- Blocks are static cubes
- Raycasting used to detect mining
- On break:
  - Block disappears
  - Points awarded based on type
  - Next block spawns in front of player
- No inventory system (v1)

Points System:
- Stone: low points
- Grass: low–medium points
- Iron: medium points
- Diamond: high points
- Score updates in real time
- Score tied to wallet public key

Environment:
- Floating spawn point or invisible platform
- Single block active at a time (v1)
- Clouds via particles or shader
- No terrain chunks / no world streaming

Game Loop:
1. User signs up → Solana wallet generated
2. Player spawns in sky lobby
3. Block spawns in front of player
4. Player mines block
5. Points awarded to wallet
6. Next block spawns
7. Loop continues

Performance Strategy:
- Instanced meshes for blocks
- Minimal draw calls
- Simple geometries & materials
- No physics engine (manual logic)

Out of Scope (v1):
- Crafting
- Survival mechanics
- Enemies / mobs
- Inventory
- Multiplayer
- Procedural terrain
- On-chain transactions (optional later)

Future Extensions:
- On-chain score anchoring
- Token rewards based on score
- Wallet-gated cosmetics
- Leaderboards by wallet
- Multiplayer mining rooms
- Daily / timed challenges

Primary Goal:
Ship a fast, addictive, web-based mining game with wallet-native identity, instant onboarding, and a clean upgrade path to on-chain rewards.